{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cOne Song, One Life\u201d</strong> is a rhythm adventure game where your performance changes both the <strong>music</strong> and the <strong>story</strong>.<br>Every note you hit determines the path of a girl chasing her dream of becoming the best net artist and standing on the same stage as her idol.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll play as <strong>Sumire Kirishima</strong>, a 19-year-old girl from Tokyo. Raised by her father after her parents\u2019 divorce, Sumire is talented but selfish\u2014willing to put everything on the line for her goals, even at the cost of others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As she climbs the ladder of the music world, she\u2019ll face temptation, manipulation, and betrayal.<br>But don\u2019t worry\u2014no matter how deep she falls, remember:<br><strong>Life itself is just one song.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101830/extras/8a1cff5a743cb6e3d1d7d0ce9c16d1dd.poster.avif?t=1765127516\" width=560 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101830/extras/8a1cff5a743cb6e3d1d7d0ce9c16d1dd.webm?t=1765127516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101830/extras/8a1cff5a743cb6e3d1d7d0ce9c16d1dd.mp4?t=1765127516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101830/extras/c65a438078edcfb8f6d3a5ce65c9841e.avif?t=1765127516\" width=547 height=628 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sumire Kirishima</strong><br>Age: 19 / Lives in Tokyo<br>Raised as a sheltered daughter by her father after her parents divorced.<br>Ambitious and strong-willed, but often self-centered and lacking in teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game System</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tap notes in rhythm</strong> with the song to build your score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101830/extras/6c8e0c28a9b20a43a3b81d94b4e24004.avif?t=1765127516\" width=700 height=486 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your path</strong> when \u201cdecision notes\u201d appear\u2014your choices shape the story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101830/extras/bdfb4bf91792132e97706b5b06e6dc68.avif?t=1765127516\" width=700 height=486 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your performance determines</strong> both the music and the scenario that unfold!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101830/extras/4d196a0c14bff154440153be956ae3f7.avif?t=1765127516\" width=700 height=486 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each song represents a lifetime</strong>\u2014see where Sumire\u2019s story ends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101830/extras/6ba4623c21baebda6edd35d9a3665faa.avif?t=1765127516\" width=700 height=486 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Miss too many notes</strong>, and it\u2019s game over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101830/extras/7a4451d00